==English==

===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ped-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|feet}}, {{m|enm|fet}}, from {{inh|en|ang|fēt}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*fōtiz}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*pódes}}, nominative plural of {{m|ine-pro|*pṓds||foot}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|Fäite|t=feet}}, {{cog|fy|fiet|t=feet}}, {{cog|de|Füße|t=feet}}, {{cog|da|fødder|t=feet}}, {{cog|sv|fötter|t=feet}}, {{cog|fo|føtur|t=feet}}, {{cog|is|fætur|t=feet}}.

